# Hardened Academic: "Whenever one or more cards leave your graveyard, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control."
# On turn 1 Bot1 casts the Academic and Faithless Looting (R), discarding two Plains: three cards went INTO the graveyard and
# none left it, so no counter (checked on turn 2: the Academic is still 2/1). On turn 3 it casts Healer's Hawk, then flashes
# Looting back (the card moves to the stack, leaving the graveyard) and the trigger's target is the Hawk, not the
# Academic: the Hawk becomes 2/2 and the Academic stays 2/1. Flashback then exiles Looting.

